  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The identity demonstrative «stesso»",
     "texto": [
      "**Stesso/a/i/e** means «same». It usually goes between the article and the noun: **Abitiamo nella stessa strada** (we live on the same street); **Abbiamo gli stessi gusti** (we have the same tastes). Placed after a pronoun or subject, it adds emphasis: **L'ho fatto io stesso** (I did it myself)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The selective interrogative «quale»",
     "texto": [
      "**Quale** (which / what) is used to choose among options from a set: **Quale autobus va in centro?** (which bus goes to the centre?); **Qual è la tua decisione?** (what is your decision?). Its plural is **quali**: **Quali libri preferisci?** (which books do you prefer?)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
